: 1) What do unicorns do?

minor spoilers...














Once you kill them, their horns can restore a whole host of things,
such as lost intrinsics, restore your health when you eat tainted corpses.

: 2) How do you carry on a meaningful conversation with someone? What good does it
: do you?

In the shops, #chat'ting with the shopkeeper while standing on an
item gives the price without having to pick it up first.

If you are in a temple with the priest of your god, chatting with the
priest causes a soliciation for a donation.  The amount you give influences
what your god gives you in return.  If you don't want to give all your 
gold, hide it in your bag.

: 3) HOW DO YOU WISH? Do you have to get specific items, etc.? What's up?

Sometimes quaffing a smoky potion will release some sort of genie, and
if lucky he will grant you a wish in return for freeing him.  Otherwise
zap a wand of wishing (WOW), if you are lucky enough to find one.

When wishing you have to name a specific item, if you screw up the spelling
you will get something else.

: 4) What does the "recover.exe" file do? I can't ever get it to do anything.

The recover command is used to restore your game after nethack has 
crashed.  I have found the command very useful for Nethack 3.1.0, as
it crashes frequently.  

